      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SNAPPY SWEETHEART (4) might be the value play. Fitter for three runs back, and ran a much better race last time at Darwin when fifth. Placed only try here and has good early speed. Take catching. GALAXY GENERAL (1) ran below expectations last time at Darwin over 1200m, finishing seventh and beaten 4 lengths. Has good early speed so should take up a forward position. Aided by the claim and will prove tough to beat. FIELD OF PRAISE (5) was runner-up last time in Darwin, beaten a head over 1200m. lose to a win and shapes as one of the key chances. ARROGANT MISS (10) has been freshened since placing in Alice Springs. Another close to a win and did place only try here. BUADES (6) should be winding up late.",
